<section id="new" class="section section--roomy">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="kicker">What's new</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">What's new in Tandem Commander.</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">The main additions and improvements in this release.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--news">
      <article class="card card--accent card--tight">
        <h3 class="card-title card-title--sm">Full Unicode, long paths</h3>
        <p class="card-text card-text--sm">Names and paths are Unicode end to end — panels, dialogs, viewers, plugins. Accents and non-Latin scripts render correctly everywhere, and paths past the old 260-character limit just work.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--accent card--tight">
        <h3 class="card-title card-title--sm">New SFTP plugin</h3>
        <p class="card-text card-text--sm">A Linux server in one panel, your disk in the other — built on libssh2 over SSH. Password or private-key auth with host-key verification, unix permissions shown as <span class="mono">drwxr-xr-x</span>, chmod from the panel.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--accent card--tight">
        <h3 class="card-title card-title--sm">Markdown View</h3>
        <p class="card-text card-text--sm">F3 on a <span class="mono">.md</span> file opens the new mdview plugin: rendered headings, lists, tables and code blocks instead of raw markup.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card card--accent card--tight">
        <h3 class="card-title card-title--sm">PictView, repaired</h3>
        <p class="card-text card-text--sm">The image viewer works again — pictures open reliably from either panel, with the fixes carried into the new Unicode-clean core.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
